# Build context hygiene for apps/relay.
#
# Two of these are not cosmetic:
#   .data/  is a relay data directory from a local run. It holds envelope
#           ciphertext and would otherwise be copied into an image layer.
#   *.pem / *.key  are certificate material. They must never enter a build
#           context, let alone an image layer, whatever .gitignore says.
.cache/
.data/
relay
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.test
